      "type": "faq-question-answer",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_cXafg3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "Types of Velcro Fasteners",
            "faq_ans": "<p>There are many type of Velcro fasteners. Velcro has become a \"catch-all\" term for wraps and fasteners, and here at CableOrganizer® we carry a wide range of both Velcro brand wraps and other types of fasteners. Such as, rubber-based adhesive, loop fabric, acrylic-based adhesive, ripwrap, and CableCatch® just to name a few. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/cable-management-tips-resources\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Cable Management Tips & Resources\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_bdJidY": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "What Are Velcro Fasteners?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>Velcro Fasteners are a cable management product that helps keep your cables, wires, and hoses together, secure, and organized. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/cable-management-tips-resources\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Cable Management Tips & Resources\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
