    "faq_question_answer_TRmDX6": {
      "type": "faq-question-answer",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_GVbVPm": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "How to Use Clamps",
            "faq_ans": "<p>There are many different types of clamps. Some need a screw inserted to help tighten / close the clamp, or they snap together. Others like the Cable Clamp® have a quick release feature that allows you to lock and unlock the clamp with one hand. When you have a longer cable run, use multiple cable clamps to help keep the cables secure. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/mommy-s-little-helpers-baby-registry-must-haves-for-safety-minded-parents\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mommy’s Little Helpers: Baby Registry Must-Haves for Safety-Minded Parents\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
