          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "What Do Clamps Do?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>Clamps help to keep your cables fastened and allow your jumble of cables to become a neat arrangement. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/easy-steps-for-protecting-cables-from-toddlers\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Easy Steps for Protecting Cables from Toddlers\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
