    "faq_question_answer_84XXTM": {
      "type": "faq-question-answer",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_6LwMkf": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "Are There Cord Covers That will Match my Décor?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>Yes, we believe that cord covers can add to a room's appeal. Use a cord cover in a coordinating shade to your flooring for a better look! <a href=\"/blogs/articles/organizing-bedroom-cables-transforming-clutter-nightmares-into-sweet-dreams\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organizing Bedroom Cables: Transforming Clutter Nightmares into Sweet Dreams\"><strong>...more</strong></a><br/><br/>Cord Covers can easily blend into any space. There are different colors and styles to choose from to help match your décor. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/4-fast-easy-and-affordable-ways-to-hide-and-protect-speaker-wire\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"4 Fast, Easy, and Affordable Ways to Hide and Protect Speaker Wire\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_9PyC4k": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "How to Hide Cable in a Classroom or Lab",
            "faq_ans": "<p>Floor Cord Covers help prevent tripping accidents. Here at CableOrganizer® we also sell curated kits that have everything you need to start organizing your space. Velcro® wraps and straps, braided sleeving, and cable ties are all great tools for organizing your classroom or lab. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/hiding-cables-in-a-computer-lab\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hiding Cables in a Computer Lab\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq_6LwMkf",
        "faq_9PyC4k"
      ],
